<title>USA: Clark USA unit sells distribution operation.</title>
<headline>Clark USA unit sells distribution operation.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clark Refining &amp; Marketing Inc, a unit of Clark USA Inc, said Monday it completed the sale of its wholesale fuel distribution operation to Atlas Oil Co for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>Clark Refining also announced it completed the purchase of 48 retail gasoline and convenience stores and a wholesale fuel distribution business from Silcorp Ltd for an unspecified amount.</p>
<p>Clark Refining said the purchase expands its retail outlets to more than 850 gasoline and convenience stores in the Midwest.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
